    <div class="newsletter-box">
      <p class="newsletter-label">// newsletter</p>
      <h2>Stay away from loop</h2>
      <p>Get the latest posts on dev, tools, and engineering delivered straight to your inbox. No spam. No Interruptions. Just the good stuff.</p>
      </p>
      <form class="newsletter-form" data-members-form="subscribe">
